insert into public.chain_menus
  (chain_id, chain_ko, chain_en, name_patterns, name_exclude, has_allergen_data, source_urls, checked_on, notes)
values
  ('bbq', 'BBQ', 'BBQ Chicken', '{"%BBQ%","%비비큐%"}'::text[], '{"%케밥%","%KEBAB%"}'::text[], true, '{"https://bbq.co.kr/categories/19","https://bbq.co.kr/categories/20","https://bbq.co.kr/categories/21","https://bbq.co.kr/products/3003"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergens, prices and origin come from bbq.co.kr''s own menu API (/api/delivery/menu/<category>), the data the official ordering site loads for each item. CAUTION: on 2026-11-24 the allergen text was not visible on the rendered product page I checked (bbq_allergen.png shows the page), so this field could not be cross-checked against what customers see. Categories used: 치킨, 피자&버거, 사이드; sauces, drinks and sets were left out. Origins listed on the site:  닭고기: 국내산; (닭고기 : 국내산); 닭고기: 국내산; 닭고기: 브라질산; 닭고기: 외국산(스웨덴, 덴마크, 태국 등); 돼지고기: 국내산; 바베큐치킨(닭고기): 브라질산과 국내산 섞음; 베이컨슬라이스(돼지고기): 외국산; 비프스트립(쇠고기): 호주산; 소시지(닭고기): 국내산; 소시지(돼지고기): 국내산; 스모크햄(돼지고기): 외국산과 국내산 섞음; 오징어: 외국산; 페퍼로니(돼지고기): 국내산; 페퍼로니플러스(돼지고기): 국내산; 페퍼로니플러스(쇠고기): 호주산; 포크탑핑(돼지고기): 외국산과 국내산 섞음. Prices are the site''s online-order prices. No shared-frying-oil statement found. name_en is the Korean name because the site has no English names.'),
  ('bhc', 'bhc', 'bhc Chicken', '{"%bhc%","%비에이치씨%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.bhc.co.kr/menu/1","https://www.bhc.co.kr/menu/23","https://www.bhc.co.kr/menu/50","https://www.bhc.co.kr/api/v1/web/products/143000"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Data comes from the ''원산지 / 영양 / 알레르기 정보'' popup on bhc.co.kr menu pages; the popup is filled from the site''s own product API (source_url per dish). Allergens are listed per component (meat, batter, sauce, boneless version...); ''contains'' is the union of all listed components, including parts marked ''순살메뉴만 해당'' (boneless only), so bone-in orders may contain less. ''알류(가금류만 해당)'' and ''계란'' mapped to egg, ''소고기'' to beef, ''조개류(굴/홍합/가리비...)'' to seafood. Chicken: 국내산 where stated. Sauces/dips, 혼치 combo sets, burger sets, dessert and 제주한정 items were left out. Prices are the site''s listed prices (0 shown as null). One pizza lists ''이황산류'' (typo for 아황산류).'),
  ('bonjuk', '본죽', 'Bonjuk', '{"%본죽%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.bonif.co.kr/brand/menu?brdCd=BF101","https://www.bonif.co.kr/brand/menu/detail?brdCd=BF101&cmdtIdx=540366"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Text table ''본죽 메뉴별 알레르기 유발물질 정보 (2026년 10월 업데이트)'' under the ''알레르기 정보'' tab of any 본죽 menu page. ''직접 유발물질'' (direct) -> contains; ''간접 유발물질'' (indirect, i.e. possible cross-contact in the store) -> may_contain. Almost every porridge lists nearly all other allergens as indirect, so may_contain is long for most items. Covers 본죽 only (not 본죽&비빔밥 or 본도시락, which are separate brands on bonif.co.kr - branch names containing ''본죽&비빔밥'' will still match %본죽%). Prices vary by store and are not in the table (null). Includes the ''추가 및 반찬'' section (add-ons and side dishes).'),
  ('burgerking', '버거킹', 'Burger King', '{"%버거킹%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.burgerking.co.kr/menu/main","https://www.burgerking.co.kr/menu/detail/1100938"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergens come from the site-wide ''원산지, 영양성분, 알레르기 유발성분'' popup (text table) opened from any menu detail page; current menu list from /menu/main (prices are not shown on the site, so null). Origin: beef patties Australia/New Zealand; chicken patties domestic/Thailand mixed depending on item (바삭킹 foreign, 너겟킹 and 크리스퍼 domestic); bacon is imported/US pork. Site note: some menu items may contain 밀, 대두, 우유, 돼지고기, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류, 난류, 게, 새우, 땅콩, 복숭아, 아황산류, 호두, 오징어, 잣 (general cross-contact notice, not per item, so not put in may_contain). Sets are omitted (they combine items listed here). name_en is the Korean name because the site has no English names. Not in the allergen table, so ''not shown'': 프렌치프라이, 21치즈스틱, 빅 딥 체다치즈, 리얼 어니언링 (the table has a plain ''어니언링'' row = 대두, 밀, probably the same item but the name differs, so it was not applied).'),
  ('frankburger', '프랭크버거', 'Frank Burger', '{"%프랭크버거%","%프랭크 버거%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.frankburger.co.kr/html/menu_1.html","https://frankburger.co.kr/html/ingredient.html","https://frankburger.co.kr/img/page/2022_menu/01/ingredient.jpg?2"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', '''원산지 / 영양성분 / 알레르기 유발 성분 보기'' on the menu page opens one image (frankburger_allergen.jpg) with a dot table; read by eye - spot-check. Site footnotes: 알류 = poultry eggs only; 조개류 includes 굴, 전복, 홍합. Origin board: beef patties US/Australia mixed (Frank, Cheese, Bacon Cheese, Double Beef Cheese, Beef & Shrimp, JG, Sweet Chili Shrimp Beef, Mac & Cheese Beef); Hanwoo (Korean beef) for the 100% Hanwoo burgers; K불고기 patty = domestic pork + Hanwoo beef fat; bacon imported (US/Spain/Brazil); chicken: whole-breast fried domestic, giant leg Thailand, Padak burger and boneless chicken Brazil, tenders China, buffalo wings imported; squid rings China. Prices are not on the official menu page (null). Drinks and small sauces left out.'),
  ('goobne', '굽네치킨', 'Goobne Chicken', '{"%굽네%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, '{"https://www.goobne.co.kr/menu/menu_list_p"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'MENU ONLY - the official site publishes no allergen information, so every dish has empty lists and allergens_as_written = ''not shown''. Show these as ''ask staff''. Menu and prices from goobne.co.kr ''메뉴보기'' (전체). No allergen, origin or nutrition page found on the site. Sauces, seasonings, toppings and egg tarts left out; pizzas, pastas and rice dishes kept as they are main menu items.'),
  ('isaac', '이삭토스트', 'Isaac Toast', '{"%이삭토스트%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, '{"https://www.isaac-toast.co.kr/menu/menu.php?ptype=list&catcode=10101000","https://www.isaac-toast.co.kr/menu/menu.php?ptype=list&catcode=10101200"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'MENU ONLY - the official site publishes no allergen information, so every dish has empty lists and allergens_as_written = ''not shown''. Show these as ''ask staff''. Toasts and sides from isaac-toast.co.kr (English names are the site''s own). No allergen, origin or nutrition info on the list or item pages; no prices shown (null). Sets, sauces/jams and drinks left out.'),
  ('kfc', 'KFC', 'KFC', '{"%KFC%","%케이에프씨%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, '{"https://www.kfckorea.com/allmenu/chicken","https://www.kfckorea.com/allmenu/burger","https://www.kfckorea.com/allmenu/snack"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'MENU ONLY - the official site publishes no allergen information, so every dish has empty lists and allergens_as_written = ''not shown''. Show these as ''ask staff''. Distinct items from kfckorea.com menu pages (치킨&세트, 버거&세트, 스낵&사이드); piece-count variants (1/3/5/8 조각) are merged into one entry, and sets, boxes, sauces, seasonings, tarts and drinks are left out. The site''s ''알레르기 유발물질'' (/menu/allergyView) and ''영양정보&원산지'' (/menu/nutritionInfo) links returned 404 on 2026-11-24. Prices are not shown on the menu pages (null).'),
  ('kyochon', '교촌치킨', 'Kyochon Chicken', '{"%교촌%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.kyochon.com/menu/chicken.asp","https://www.kyochon.com/menu/allergyinfo.asp","https://www.kyochon.com/images/menu/allergyinfo_20261123_pc.jpg"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergen table is one image dated 2026-11-23 (kyochon_allergen.jpg, ''주요 알레르기 성분''); read by eye from zoomed crops - spot-check. 계란 mapped to egg, 조개류(굴) to seafood; 복숭아/토마토/아황산류 kept only in allergens_as_written. The same image has an origin board (원산지 표시판 CO-STD-261123): main chicken series and wing series are listed with their own origin; part of it is cut off in the image, so origins were not copied. One item page (허니윙콤비) says 닭고기(태국산), so wing products may be imported. Prices are on individual item pages as ''권장소비자가격'' and vary by store; not collected (null). Sauces were left out. name_en = Korean name (no English names on site).'),
  ('lotteria', '롯데리아', 'Lotteria', '{"%롯데리아%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, '{"https://www.lotteeatz.com/brand/ria"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'MENU ONLY - the official site publishes no allergen information, so every dish has empty lists and allergens_as_written = ''not shown''. Show these as ''ask staff''. Menu and prices from LOTTE EATZ (lotteeatz.com, Lotte GRS''s official ordering site). Its product page template has allergen/origin sections but they are commented out, so nothing is shown. Categories: 버거, 디저트 (sides), 치킨; packs, drinks and ice desserts left out. Prices are LOTTE EATZ online prices.'),
  ('mcdonalds', '맥도날드', 'McDonald''s', '{"%맥도날드%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.mcdonalds.co.kr/kor/menu/information/allergens","https://www.mcdonalds.co.kr/kor/menu/information/origin","https://www.mcdonalds.co.kr/kor/menu/burger"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergen table (text, dated 2026.11.24 on the page) sections 버거, 스낵 & 사이드 and 단품 (breakfast). ''굴'' and ''조개'' are mapped to seafood. Where an item comes with dips/ketchup, allergens_as_written keeps the full official line but ''contains'' uses only the item''s own group (e.g. 맥너겟: 대두, 밀, 닭고기; the cajun dip adds 난류, 대두, 굴). Origin: beef patties Australia; bulgogi patty domestic pork; McSpicy Shanghai chicken domestic; McCrispy chicken Thailand/Brazil by region; shrimp patty Thailand; bacon imported pork. Breakfast sauce contains pickles (site note). Prices are not shown on the site (null). 홍천 우리쌀 칩 has an empty row on the site (not shown).'),
  ('momstouch', '맘스터치', 'Mom''s Touch', '{"%맘스터치%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.momstouch.co.kr/menu/new.php?s_sect1=CG0005","https://www.momstouch.co.kr/menu/new.php?s_sect1=CG0004","https://www.momstouch.co.kr/menu/new.php?s_sect1=CG0002","https://www.momstouch.co.kr/upload_file/delv_guide/1795048763-BRSSH.png","https://www.momstouch.co.kr/upload_file/delv_guide/1795396732-FYSGH.png"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergen table (알레르기 유발식품 표시, dated 2026-11-19) is a single image linked from every menu page (saved as momstouch_allergen.png); per-dish allergens were read from it by eye, so spot-check. Chicken ''(순살)'' items use the table''s ''빅싸이순살'' rows; the ''와우순살'' variant additionally lists 우유 (dairy). Origin board (momstouch_origin.png): chicken is domestic or Brazil/Thailand depending on item; bulgogi patty beef from Australia plus domestic pork/chicken; smash/beef patty beef from Australia; bacon is imported pork. No shared-frying-oil statement found. Prices shown only on some item pages; items showing 0원 are null. 치킨무 is not in the allergen table.'),
  ('pelicana', '페리카나', 'Pelicana', '{"%페리카나%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.pelicana.co.kr/menu/list","https://www.pelicana.co.kr/menu/origin","https://www.pelicana.co.kr/menu/detail?goodsNo=1000100303"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergens and origin are text on each item page (''알레르기 정보''). Prices are the site''s listed prices; the site notes they may differ by store/channel and not every store sells every item. All chicken (incl. gizzards, feet, neck) is domestic (국내산). Nearly every chicken item lists 쇠고기 (beef). Two cheese-ball sides say ''유유'', an obvious typo for 우유 (milk) - mapped to dairy; 계란 mapped to egg; 조개류(굴포함) mapped to seafood. No shared-frying-oil statement found.'),
  ('subway', '써브웨이', 'Subway', '{"%써브웨이%","%서브웨이%","%subway%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], true, '{"https://www.subway.co.kr/menuList/sandwich","https://www.subway.co.kr/sandwichAllergy","https://www.subway.co.kr/images/menu/allergy_img.png?2026110901","https://www.subway.co.kr/sandwichCountry"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'Allergen chart is one image (subway_allergen.png); ● = contains, ★ = may contain (mapped to may_contain). Values are for the base sandwich only: wheat bread + lettuce, tomato, pepper, onion, cucumber; NO cheese or sauce (except 스테이크&치즈 and breakfast items, which include American cheese) - bread, cheese and sauce choices add their own allergens (the chart lists them separately). Site warns of cross-contact during preparation. (F)/(S) variants of 안창 비프&머쉬룸 and 머쉬룸 appear as separate rows in the chart with different values; both are kept. (J)/(JC) store-variant rows were skipped. 램 = lamb, but lamb is not an allergen column, so it is not in ''contains''. Prices are not shown on the site (null). Read by eye from the image - spot-check.'),
  ('yupdduk', '엽기떡볶이', 'Yupdduk (Dongdaemun Yupgi Tteokbokki)', '{"%엽기떡볶이%","%엽떡%"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, '{"https://www.yupdduk.com/sub/menu/yup-menu"}'::text[], '2026-11-24', 'MENU ONLY - the official site publishes no allergen information, so every dish has empty lists and allergens_as_written = ''not shown''. Show these as ''ask staff''. The menu popup on yupdduk.com has an allergen field (#sel_al_info) but it was empty for every item on 2026-11-24. Prices are the site''s listed prices. Sets, toppings, meal kits, sauces, seasoning and drinks left out.');
insert into public.chain_menu_dishes
  (chain_id, dish_no, name_ko, name_en, price_won, contains, may_contain, allergens_as_written, source_url)
values
  ('bbq', 1, '황금올리브치킨™', '황금올리브치킨™', 23000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3003'),
  ('bbq', 2, '자메이카 통다리구이', '자메이카 통다리구이', 24000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '대두, 밀, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기,, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3033'),
  ('bbq', 3, '뿜치킹', '뿜치킹', 25000, '{"beef","chicken","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 닭고기, 쇠고기', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/30352'),
  ('bbq', 4, '황금올리브치킨™핫크리스피', '황금올리브치킨™핫크리스피', 24000, '{"pork","beef","chicken","seafood","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 돼지고기, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3009'),
  ('bbq', 5, '황금올리브치킨™블랙페퍼', '황금올리브치킨™블랙페퍼', 24000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3022'),
  ('bbq', 6, '스모크치킨(5조각)', '스모크치킨(5조각)', 22000, '{"chicken","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '대두, 닭고기', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3035'),
  ('bbq', 7, '[황.양.반] 황올 반+양념 반', '[황.양.반] 황올 반+양념 반', 24000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3105'),
  ('bbq', 8, '황금올리브치킨™양념', '황금올리브치킨™양념', 24500, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3108'),
  ('bbq', 9, '황금올리브치킨™속안심', '황금올리브치킨™속안심', 19000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3006'),
  ('bbq', 10, '크런치버터치킨', '크런치버터치킨', 24000, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 새우, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/3024'),
  ('bbq', 11, '핫베이크 윙', '핫베이크 윙', 24000, '{"pork","beef","chicken","seafood","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 돼지고기, 토마토, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/30215'),
  ('bbq', 12, '맵소디', '맵소디', 24500, '{"beef","chicken","seafood","egg","dairy","peanut","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 우유, 땅콩, 대두, 밀, 닭고기, 쇠고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/30243'),
  ('bbq', 13, '땡쇼크', '땡쇼크', 25000, '{"chicken","seafood","egg","wheat","soy"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '알류, 대두, 밀, 아황산류, 닭고기, 조개류', 'https://bbq.co.kr/products/30214'),
